What are Laser Measurement Solutions for Automotive Production?
Laser measurement solutions consist of inline 3‑D scanners, laser radar systems, laser trackers and displacement sensors that capture micron‑level geometry without physical contact. In modern body‑in‑white (BIW) stations, these systems replace traditional mechanical gauges, enabling real‑time feedback to robotic presses and welding cells. The technology not only reduces rework but also helps manufacturers meet tighter tolerance windows required for lightweight alloys, composite structures and battery‑module housings.
